 networks.</article-title><source>Phys Rev Lett</source><volume>101</volume><fpage>215501</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">19113422</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0005902-Head1"><label>12</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Head</surname><given-names>DA</given-names></name><name><surname>Levine</surname><given-names>AJ</given-names></name><name><surname>MacKintosh</surname><given-names>FC</given-names></name></person-group><year>2003</year><article-title>Deformation of cross-linked semiflexible polymer networks.</article-title><source>Phys Rev Lett</source><volume>91</volume><fpage>108102</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14525510</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0005902-Wilhelm1"><label>13</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wilhelm</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Frey</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name></person-group><year>2003</year><article-title>Elasticity of stiff polymer networks.</article-title><source>Phys Rev Lett</source><volume>91</volume><fpage>108103</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14525511</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0005902-Onck1"><label>14</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Onck</surname><given-names>PR</given-names></name><name><surname>Koeman</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>van Dillen</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>van der Giessen</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name></person-group><year>2005</year><article-title>Alternative explanation of stiffening in cross-linked semiflexible networks.</article-title><source>Phys Rev Lett</source><volume>95</volume><fpage>178102</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16383874</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0005902-Billiar1"><label>15</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-typ